changelog             = ✅ 1. Permissions & session\n[Roles] Only a superadmin can create admins or grant the admin role, closing a privilege-escalation path\n[Session] The session cookie's Secure flag is now decided by the real protocol behind a reverse proxy/gateway\n✅ 2. Migration & notices\n[Migration] Added an admin endpoint listing accounts that still hold server-decryptable legacy entries; the plaintext migration API is planned for removal in 0.3.0, with a notice banner on the user-management page\n✅ 3. Hardening\n[Web] The admin console CSP no longer allows unsafe-eval, removing the code-execution surface under script injection\n[Rate limit] Fixed a setup-endpoint limiter key table that was never periodically cleaned
